# =====================================================================================
# receipts.ttl — the ACCEPTANCE receipt of the V7 provenance-closure lane (W2 SP0, T-PROV).
# =====================================================================================
# The D24 Modular-Option-A+ receipts/ artifact: the Accepted-state seal of the executor+shadow
# review lane (Draft -> ExecutorValidation -> ShadowCritique -> Resolution -> ShadowRevalidation ->
# Accepted). It is a prov:Entity generated by the Accepted lifecycle activity and attributed to
# BOTH the executor and the shadow agent — the dual signature the whole gate enforces — recording
# that all twenty-nine reshaped records closed executor >= 1 AND shadow >= 1 under the runner's V7
# dual-count and probes/provenance_closure.rq. A receipt is integrity evidence, never a semantic
# proof (design honesty: the seal records that the gate ran GREEN, not that mathematics is certified).
#
# Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-w2-sp0-primordial-fold-design.md (§4 V7).
# Plan:   docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-06-w2-sp0-spine-fold-plan.md (Task T-PROV).
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix gprov: <urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:governance:provenance:> .

<urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:governance:provenance:receipt:accepted:sp0:spine:fold>
    a owl:NamedIndividual , prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:label "SP0 spine-fold V7 provenance-closure receipt (Accepted)" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:governance:provenance:activity:lifecycle:accepted:sp0:spine:fold> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:governance:provenance:agent:executor:sp0:spine:fold> , <urn:silmaril:type:graph:instance:instruction:code:property:governance:provenance:agent:shadow:sp0:spine:fold> ;
    prov:value "Accepted: 29/29 reshaped records dual-attributed (executor>=1 AND shadow>=1) + prov:wasGeneratedBy; runner gate V7 GREEN; probes/provenance_closure.rq 0 rows on the clean tree; the empty half of the reference governance/ layer is now built (design §4 V7 GAP closed for the spine)." .
